    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d408">

                <pb facs="0465" n="293" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg293"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/625</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bailly-Blanchard</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-02T10:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 2, 1917, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 2.10 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your May 25, 4 p.m. Minister for Foreign Affairs states that Haitian Government
                    has been approached regarding conference and will reply, expressing regret that
                    in view of the financial situation of the Republic of Haiti it will be unable to
                    be represented at the conference.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Blanchard</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
